(text "VIN rail = lowest standard rail >= VOUT + VDO(max). Eff. = VOUT*IOUT / (VIN*(IOUT + divider/bleeder current)).\nPD @IOUT = (VIN-VOUT)*IOUT at rated 1.0 A ; dT = thetaJA*PD = junction temperature rise above ambient (thetaJA 160 C/W).\ndT > ~75 C means the rated current is not usable on that rail at 50 C ambient - see IOUT max @50C (thermal limit, capped at rating)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 215.90 167.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1b1e2d9f-a999-4723-b0dc-d0fd8f301bbf"))
)
